Package: gwrs
Type: Package
Title: Fast Geographically Weighted Regression and Selection
Version: 0.4.0.9013
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Bahadir",
      family = "Yuzbasi",
      email = "b.yzb@hotmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
  )
Description: Fits geographically weighted regression with ridge, lasso and
    elastic-net regularization, together with smoothly clipped absolute
    deviation (SCAD) and minimax concave penalty (MCP) estimators for local
    variable selection. Provides model fitting, regularization paths,
    spatial cross-validation, prediction and coefficient summaries.
    Computational kernels use 'RcppArmadillo' and 'RcppParallel' with
    reusable nearest-neighbor structures.
